WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.052
Handwashing, in five steps.

2
00:00:03.252 --> 00:00:07.675
Step 1: Wet your hands with clean, running water.

3
00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:10.848
Step 2: Lather them with soap.

4
00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:15.683
The backs of your hands, between your fingers,
and under your nails.

5
00:00:15.883 --> 00:00:19.896
Step 3: Scrub for at least 20 seconds.

6
00:00:20.096 --> 00:00:24.713
Step 4: Rinse them well under clean, running water.

7
00:00:24.913 --> 00:00:29.807
Step 5: Dry them with a clean towel, or let them air dry.
